48
00:02:41,720 --> 00:02:46,020
Do it the same way you do when you gas your car up.

49
00:02:46,120 --> 00:02:51,160
Put in the truck number, the mileage, and the driver ID.

50
00:02:51,260 --> 00:02:54,660
This authorizes the pump so that they know who's using it.

51
00:02:54,661 --> 00:02:57,860
Then you simply turn on the pump, open up your tank,

52
00:02:57,960 --> 00:02:59,660
