53
00:02:59,760 --> 00:03:02,060
But we as truckers have one more thing we can do.

54
00:03:02,160 --> 00:03:05,300
Let me show you a trick.

55
00:03:05,400 --> 00:03:07,600
Most trucks have two fuel tanks.

56
00:03:07,700 --> 00:03:10,000
So when it comes time to fuel the other side,

57
00:03:10,100 --> 00:03:13,920
