82
00:04:24,700 --> 00:04:28,500
It's just the spot for big rigs that need big baths.

83
00:04:28,600 --> 00:04:29,800
Truck and trailer wash.

84
00:04:29,900 --> 00:04:30,700
Truck and trailer.

85
00:04:30,800 --> 00:04:33,600
All right.

86
00:04:33,700 --> 00:04:36,100
The truck wash uses a combination of manpower

87
00:04:36,200 --> 00:04:39,420
and machine power.

88
00:04:39,520 --> 00:04:41,320
We hand scrub the rigs because it's

89
00:04:41,420 --> 00:04:42,820
the more traditional way of doing it.

90
00:04:42,920 --> 00:04:45,420
But the sides of the trailers have to be scrubbed.

91
00:04:45,520 --> 00:04:48,660
And if we did it by hand, it would take 20 minutes, probably.

92
00:04:48,760 --> 00:04:51,620
So we fabricated this machine to do that for us.

93
00:04:51,621 --> 00:04:54,620
The brush comes out with air power, and it spins,

94
00:04:54,720 --> 00:04:57,120
and it does the sides of the trailers.

95
00:04:57,220 --> 00:04:58,920
As the machine's going, we don't have to do anything.

96
00:04:59,020 --> 00:05:01,160
We just do our job, and the machine will do its job,

97
00:05:01,260 --> 00:05:05,060
