98
00:05:05,160 --> 00:05:07,560
Washers even clean under the hood.

99
00:05:07,660 --> 00:05:11,080
Wielding a high-pressure wand, it sprays more than 1,500 pounds

100
00:05:11,180 --> 00:05:14,580
per square inch of water.

101
00:05:14,680 --> 00:05:18,180
That's 50 times stronger than the average garden hose.

102
00:05:18,280 --> 00:05:19,880
It's 180-degree water.

103
00:05:19,881 --> 00:05:23,120
takes off all the grime and salt and oil and whatnot

104
00:05:23,220 --> 00:05:24,620
