128
00:06:38,700 --> 00:06:41,240
Under his management, the site flourished

129
00:06:41,241 --> 00:06:44,540
You know, in here is one of the best things I've ever found

130
00:06:44,640 --> 00:06:45,980
in a truck stop.

131
00:06:46,080 --> 00:06:48,740
It's the trucker's store.

132
00:06:48,840 --> 00:06:50,980
This 30,000 square foot showroom

133
00:06:51,080 --> 00:06:53,880
