136
00:06:59,260 --> 00:07:02,560
As we do our yards and as we fix our house up,

137
00:07:02,660 --> 00:07:04,700
truck drivers feel that way about their trucks.

138
00:07:04,800 --> 00:07:08,300
They're in them all year round, and they want to make them look

139
00:07:08,400 --> 00:07:09,400
