00:41:46,761 --> 00:41:49,300
For 25 years, the fuel at Carl's Corner,

772
00:41:49,301 --> 00:41:53,360
like at most truck stops, was conventional diesel.

773
00:41:53,361 --> 00:41:56,500
Then Willie started learning about biodiesel.

774
00:41:56,501 --> 00:41:59,300
My wife, Annie, came to me one day and said,

775
00:41:59,301 --> 00:42:00,560
I want to buy this car.

776
00:42:00,561 --> 00:42:02,600
It's a Volkswagen Jetta.

777
00:42:02,601 --> 00:42:05,500
And it's a diesel, but it runs on vegetable oil.

778
00:42:05,501 --> 00:42:09,300
So she did, and it runs on vegetable oil.

779
00:42:09,301 --> 00:42:12,900
So I thought that was pretty good.

780
00:42:13,000 --> 00:42:17,600
Willie learned that any diesel engine can run on biodiesel.

781
00:42:17,700 --> 00:42:20,620
In fact, when inventor Rudolph Diesel presented the first diesel

782
00:42:20,720 --> 00:42:24,920
engine in 1900, it was designed to run not on petroleum,

783
00:42:25,020 --> 00:42:27,680
but peanut oil.

784
00:42:27,780 --> 00:42:29,880
But since petroleum was more commercially available

785
00:42:29,980 --> 00:42:32,420
in the early decades of the 20th century,

786
00:42:32,520 --> 00:42:34,320
the idea of biodiesel faded away.

787
00:42:37,460 --> 00:42:39,060
In recent years, however, many have

788
00:42:39,061 --> 00:42:42,360
recognized biodiesel's benefits.

789
00:42:42,460 --> 00:42:47,960
And in 2004, Nelson set out to create his own brand.

790
00:42:48,060 --> 00:42:50,880
And what better place to sell it than the truck stop owned

791
00:42:50,980 --> 00:42:52,440
by his buddy Carl?

792
00:42:52,540 --> 00:42:55,440
He was thinking about closing the truck stop down.

793
00:42:55,540 --> 00:42:57,340
And so I called him and said, wait a minute,

794
00:42:57,440 --> 00:43:00,040
let's sell some biodiesel down there.

795
00:43:00,140 --> 00:43:01,480
And I said, well, you believe in it?

796
00:43:01,580 --> 00:43:02,920
And he said, well, yeah, I believe in it.

797
00:43:03,020 --> 00:43:04,380
And I said, well, let's do the whole damn thing.

798
00:43:04,480 --> 00:43:06,120
I don't have the reason to sell diesel.

799
00:43:06,220 --> 00:43:07,280
Let's just sell biodiesel.

800
00:43:07,380 --> 00:43:09,060
And that's what we did.

801
00:43:09,061 --> 00:43:12,800
Carl partnered with both Willie and Earth Biofuels

802
00:43:12,900 --> 00:43:15,560
and made plans to update the truck stop.

803
00:43:15,660 --> 00:43:20,700
During 2006 and 2007, Carl's Corner got a major makeover,

804
00:43:20,800 --> 00:43:25,100
adding a new saloon and renovating an 850 seat theater

805
00:43:25,200 --> 00:43:27,320
so Willie can stop by and perform at any time.

806
00:43:29,420 --> 00:43:34,160
Willie's place at Carl's Corner is what we as a company

807
00:43:34,260 --> 00:43:39,020
had envisioned would become the symbol of the biofuel

808
00:43:39,060 --> 00:43:41,560
and the integrated model we wanted to build.

809
00:43:41,660 --> 00:43:45,360
We're trying to show the farmers can bring it to market

810
00:43:45,460 --> 00:43:48,700
and the biodiesel plant is there.

811
00:43:48,800 --> 00:43:50,100
The truck stop is here.

812
00:43:50,200 --> 00:43:52,000
The interstate is here.

813
00:43:52,100 --> 00:43:55,580
And it's all locally owned.

814
00:43:55,680 --> 00:43:58,540
And everything will stay in the community

815
00:43:58,640 --> 00:44:03,020
and not be sent off to somebody overseas or something.

816
00:44:03,120 --> 00:44:04,860
More and more truck stop owners

817
00:44:04,960 --> 00:44:07,180
are following Willie and Carl's example,

818
00:44:07,181 --> 00:44:11,180
offering biodiesel as an alternative fuel.

819
00:44:11,280 --> 00:44:13,980
Counted among the many innovations that have redefined

820
00:44:14,080 --> 00:44:17,620
these ever-evolving roadside oases,

821
00:44:17,720 --> 00:44:21,120
they'll continue to give drivers what they need so that they can

822
00:44:21,220 --> 00:44:23,120
do what they do best.

823
00:44:23,220 --> 00:44:24,540
Keep on trucking.

